    id: "stage6_state_machine",
    title: "Make the state machine a type",
    lede: "Each state is its own type, carrying what that state has: a capture has a capture time, a failure has a reason, and neither has the other. `capture` takes an `Authorized` and a `PayoutEnabledVendor`, and there is no way to obtain either except by passing the check that produces it.",
